+    The Anytype local API reads objects as AnyBlock JSON documents and edits them with PATCH operations. GET /v2/schemas lists document kinds; GET /v2/schemas/{kind} and GET /v2/schemas/ops/{op} describe document and edit-operation inputs. Path and query parameters and edit-operation names use snake_case. Use the JSON field names shown in the schemas.
